  "notes": [
    "The permissionless mint is in the token's immutable runtime from its deployment; both vaults that accept it (0x75a04a1f for ShezUSD, 0x59247625 for ShezETH) were drained through it, so their drains are one incident. ShezUSD is a target because the anchor's borrow needed the vault's MINTER_ROLE, granted in the launch batch 0xdca29764 (rule 10).",
    "Campaign: every mint() call on the token (15) plus the disposal txs by the minting actors that sold bug-minted ShezUSD/ShezETH into the Curve USDC and WETH pools and Balancer. Loss is those pools' depletion netted per tx; sales by other holders are not attributed. Later negotiated returns are not subtracted."
  ],
